# Research governance metadata is intentionally small and versioned. Large
# per-sample outputs remain ignored under results/.
!experiments/
!experiments/results/
!experiments/**/*.json
!experiments/**/*.jsonl
!experiments/**/*.csv
third_party/

# Agent scratch space. Subagents write long logs/tables/diffs here instead of
# returning them inline. Must stay ignored: tools/experiment.py treats any
# untracked file as a dirty worktree and refuses to start a reportable run.
.claude/scratch/

# Local session transcript dumps written at the repository root. Same reason as
# above: an untracked file blocks every reportable training/evaluation start.
/20[0-9][0-9]-[0-9][0-9]-[0-9][0-9]-*.txt
